# Startup/Logon Script Added to Group Policy Object | T1484.001, T1547 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/builtin/security/win_security_susp_group_policy_startup_script_added_to_gpo.yml
source="WinEventLog:Security" (EventCode IN (5136, 5145)) (((AttributeLDAPDisplayName IN ("gPCMachineExtensionNames", "gPCUserExtensionNames")) AttributeValue="*42B5FAAE-6536-11D2-AE5A-0000F87571E3*" (AttributeValue IN ("*40B6664F-4972-11D1-A7CA-0000F87571E3*", "*40B66650-4972-11D1-A7CA-0000F87571E3*"))) OR (ShareName="*\\SYSVOL" (RelativeTargetName IN ("*\\scripts.ini", "*\\psscripts.ini")) AccessList="*%%4417*"))
